sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Pipeline
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Webhook as spark-operator-webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Controller as spark-operator-controller
    participant Driver as Driver Pod
    participant Executors as Executor Pods<br/>7078/TCP, 7079/TCP
    participant ModuleCtrl as spark-operator-module-controller
    participant ODHOp as ODH/RHOAI Operator

    Note over User,Executors: Flow 1: SparkApplication Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkApplication CR<br/>Auth: User token / SA
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>HTTPS/443 → 9443<br/>TLS 1.2+ (CA bundle)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated & Mutated CR
    K8sAPI-->>User: SparkApplication created

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkApplication CRs<br/>SA: spark-operator-controller
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: SparkApplication event

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>+ Service, ConfigMap
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Pod created

    Driver->>K8sAPI: Request Executor Pods<br/>SA: spark-operator-spark
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review (Pod)<br/>Mutate Spark config
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Pod spec
    K8sAPI-->>Driver: Executors scheduled

    Driver->>Executors: Spark RPC<br/>7078/TCP (driver-rpc)<br/>7079/TCP (blockmanager)
    Executors-->>Driver: Task results

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update SparkApplication status<br/>Running → Completed

    Note over ODHOp,ModuleCtrl: Flow 2: Module Controller Lifecycle

    ODHOp->>K8sAPI: Create/Update SparkOperator CR
    ModuleCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkOperator CR<br/>SA: spark-operator-module-controller-manager
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleCtrl: SparkOperator event

    ModuleCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments<br/>CRDs, RBAC, Webhooks, NetworkPolicies
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleCtrl: Resources applied
    ModuleCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update SparkOperator status<br/>Conditions: Ready
